From: Stoicoci Mihaita <stoicocimihaita@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:26:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] softisp: contrast-detection autofocus (q706f first
 version)

- SwStatsCpu: contrast measure (squared horizontal green differences in the
  central quarter) for 10-bit packed Bayer.
- softisp IPA: Af algorithm (coarse sweep with early stop, fine scan, lock,
  refocus on a sustained contrast drop), enabled from the tuning file.
- IPA interface: setLensPosition signal; simple pipeline moves the sensor's
  focus lens (CameraLens).
